# =============================================================================
# LLM-FeatureSelection-ICU-Delirium
#
# Two categories below must never be committed:
#   (1) patient-level data  - the MIMIC-IV data use agreement prohibits
#       redistribution. Only credentialed PhysioNet users may obtain it.
#   (2) API credentials
# Everything else (code, prompts, LLM outputs, aggregate tables) is shareable.
# =============================================================================

# ── Patient-level data — MIMIC-IV DUA -----------------------------------------
mimic_iv_dataset*
bq-results-*
# BigQuery/browser exports can be saved without a file extension.
# Match this patient-level extract name in any directory, with or without one.
delirium_patients*
*.parquet
*.feather
*.pkl
*.pickle
*.sav
*.dta
# any file whose name marks it as a patient-level extract
*cohort*.csv
*patients*.csv
*_raw.csv

# Local Codex/document-rendering scratch files
.codex_tmp/

# ── Credentials ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
credentials*.json
service_account*.json
client_secret*.json

# ── Copyrighted third-party material ------------------------------------------
cited_papers/
*.pdf

# ── Manuscript drafts (kept out of the code repository) -----------------------
*.docx
*.doc
*.pptx
~$*
*.tmp
*~WRL*

# ── Python ---------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.python-version

# ── Jupyter --------------------------------------------------------------------
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*-checkpoint.ipynb
profile_default/
ipython_config.py

# ── Tooling / caches -----------------------------------------------------------
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.ipynb_cache/
.cache/
*.log

# ── Editors ---------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# ── OS ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.lnk

# =============================================================================
# Intentionally tracked — listed here so the exclusions above are not widened
# by mistake. None of these contain patient-level rows.
#
#   1. feature pool generator/*.txt          feature pool, mappings, exclusions
#   1. feature pool generator/*.xlsx         labels extracted from source papers
#   2. feature selection experiment/results/ raw LLM responses (JSONL) + aggregates
#   3. analyze feature selection method/outputs/   analysis tables and figures
#   4. evaluation with MIMIC-IV/*.sql        extraction and verification queries
#   4. evaluation with MIMIC-IV/outputs/     aggregate results (no patient rows)
#
# Note: results/lmprior/gpt/*.jsonl store full logprob arrays and total ~22 MB.
# They are kept for reproducibility. To exclude them instead, uncomment:
# 2. feature selection experiment/results/lmprior/
# =============================================================================
